      "transcript": "N: Questions 71 through 73 refer to the following announcement.\nW: Attention, passengers on Flight 482 to Toronto. Due to heavy fog, the departure has been delayed by approximately ninety minutes.\nW: The new departure time is eleven-forty. Passengers should remain in the gate area and listen for further announcements.\nW: A complimentary snack voucher is available at the Gate 12 service desk. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
