      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Voicemail from a supplier",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 74 through 76 refer to the following telephone message.\nM: Hello, Ms. Okoye. This is Raymond from Delta Office Supply. I'm calling about your order of two hundred notebooks.\nM: Unfortunately, the blue ones are out of stock until next week. We can send the black ones now or hold the entire order until the blue ones arrive.\nM: Please call me back at 555-0192 before four o'clock today so I can arrange the delivery. Thank you.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-03",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Museum tour",
      "body": "WHITFIELD MARITIME MUSEUM — Floor plan\nGround floor: Harbor Hall, Gift Shop, Exit\nFirst floor: Navigation Room\nSecond floor: Captain's Gallery",
      "transcript": "N: Questions 77 through 79 refer to the following tour introduction.\nW: Good morning, and welcome to the Whitfield Maritime Museum. I'm your guide, Hannah. Our tour will last about an hour and take us through three galleries.\nW: We'll begin in the Harbor Hall, where you'll see the model ships. Then we'll visit the Navigation Room, and finish in the Captain's Gallery.\nW: Please note that photography is permitted, but flash is not allowed. If you'd like to buy souvenirs, the gift shop is next to the exit.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-04",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Radio advertisement",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 80 through 82 refer to the following advertisement.\nM: Looking for the perfect home office? Visit Bright Desk Furniture this weekend only. Take thirty percent off all desks and chairs.\nM: Our adjustable standing desks start at two hundred forty dollars. Buy any desk, and we'll deliver it free within the city.\nM: Bring this ad to the store on Mill Street, and receive a free desk lamp. Offer ends Sunday at six.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-05",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Staff meeting",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 83 through 85 refer to the following excerpt from a meeting.\nW: Thanks for coming, everyone. I have two updates. First, starting next month, the customer service line will be open until eight in the evening on weekdays.\nW: That means we'll need volunteers for the late shift, which will pay an extra three dollars an hour.\nW: Second, our new scheduling software goes live on Monday. Please check your login details in your email, and contact the IT desk if you have trouble signing in.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-06",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Weather and event report",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 86 through 88 refer to the following radio broadcast.\nM: And now for the weather and your weekend plans. Expect sunny skies on Saturday with a high of twenty-six degrees, followed by showers on Sunday afternoon.\nM: If you're heading to the Riverside Food Festival, it runs from ten to nine on Saturday, but organizers say Sunday's closing time has been moved up to four o'clock because of the forecast.\nM: Free shuttle buses will run from Central Station every fifteen minutes.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-07",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Workshop announcement",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 89 through 91 refer to the following talk.\nW: Welcome to the Spring Marketing Workshop. Before we start, a few reminders about today's schedule.\nW: The session on social media has been moved from Room A to Room C because of a projector problem. Lunch will be served at noon in the main hall.\nW: Finally, please complete the feedback form in your folder before you leave. As a thank-you, everyone who returns it will receive a gift card for the bookstore downstairs.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-08",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Product demonstration",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 92 through 94 refer to the following talk.\nM: Thank you for joining this demonstration of the Aria blender. Unlike older models, the Aria runs on a quiet motor and has a self-cleaning mode that takes just thirty seconds.\nM: It comes with a five-year warranty and three different containers, including a travel cup.\nM: If you place an order today, you'll receive a free recipe book, and shipping will cost nothing.",
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b03-pass-09",
      "kind": "talk",
      "title": "Manager's farewell speech",
      "body": null,
      "transcript": "N: Questions 95 through 97 refer to the following speech.\nW: Before we start the party, I want to thank everyone for the past eleven years. When I joined this company, we had one office and twelve employees.\nW: Today we have three offices and more than two hundred colleagues. I'm proud of what we've built together.\nW: My successor, Ms. Alvarez, will start on Monday. I'm confident that she will lead you well. Now, please, enjoy the cake.",
      "image": null
    },
