      "body": "DUNFORD – HALSEY\nExpress train journey time: 30 minutes\nLocal trains: stop at every station",
      "transcript": "N: Questions 98 through 100 refer to the following announcement.\nM: May I have your attention, please. Because of track maintenance, the express trains between Dunford and Halsey will not run this weekend.\nM: Local trains will operate every thirty minutes instead, and the journey will take about twenty minutes longer.\nM: Tickets purchased for express service will be honored on local trains. For updated schedules, visit our website or speak to a station attendant.",
